- [x] Ledger identity/grace/reconcile/claim lifecycle.
- [x] Saved-mutation and fail-closed wipe race proof.

## Delivery & Verification Evidence
- **Completion Date:** 2026-10-15 (100% progress / 20h credited; Gate G5 passed).
- **Scope Delivered:**
  - **Shared Schedule Calculator & Preview:** `ReminderScheduleCalculator` (`shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/shared/contract/reminder-schedule-calculator.kt`) with checked 64-bit integer arithmetic (`safeMultiply`, `safeSubtract`, `safeAdd`), repetition limits (`1..10`), anchor boundary checks, strict timezone/DST offset resolution (`StrictTimeZoneResolver`), 5-minute grace window (`due <= now && now - due <= 300_000ms`), and preview interval derivation.
  - **Draft-Free Reactive Persisted Projection:** `PersistedScheduleProjector` (`shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/shared/contract/persisted-schedule-projector.kt`) observing committed Room base and submitted outbox intentions (`STATE_PENDING`, `STATE_DISPATCHING`, `STATE_UNCERTAIN`), strictly isolating uncommitted drafts (`editor_drafts`), applying intent overlay in `localRevision` order, and enforcing cancellation barriers for saved completion, deletion, or rule disabling.
  - **Durable Occurrence Ledger Store:** `ReminderOccurrenceStore` (`shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/shared/data/reminder-occurrence-store.kt`) backed by `reminder_delivery_ledger` entity, implementing durable claim-before-post semantics, generation-fenced occurrence keys (`accountKey:generation:rowId:scheduleToken:index`), atomic skipping of missed opportunities, and ledger cleanup (`clearPostedNotificationId`) upon obsolete notification removal.
  - **Shared Delivery Gate & Coordination:** `ReminderDeliveryGate` (`shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/shared/sync/reminder-delivery-gate.kt`) and `ReminderSchedulingCoordinator` (`shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/shared/sync/reminder-scheduling-coordinator.kt`) enforcing the documented lock hierarchy (`DeliveryGate -> Store Mutex -> SQLite Room Transaction`), pre-post eligibility re-checking under gate admission, and non-blocking native obsolete cleanup with retry retention on adapter failure.
  - **Fail-Closed Account Leave Protocol:** `AccountLeaveProtocol` (`shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/shared/sync/account-leave-protocol.kt`) coordinating sync scheduler and reminder coordinator teardown, retaining `store.isFrozen = true` across all abort/failure paths after `closeAndDrain()`, generation overflow protection (`Long.MAX_VALUE`), and barrier synchronization draining in-flight callbacks before wipe marker persistence, Room closure, and database file deletion.

