| ID | Concrete scenario and expected observable outcome | Owning phases | Evidence required | Status / Gate Progress |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| AC01 | Offline create/edit/clear date-only/timed rule; restart preserves exact values. Cancel unsaved edit does not touch ledger/native handles. Open populated Room1 DB containing all queue states; migration retains records/intents, no deadline and disabled reminder. | 05,07,10,11 | Actual DB migrate/reopen/save/restart; editor/native handle observation; protected fixture assertions | **Partially Validated (Logic & DB PASS / Physical Reboot Held)**: 23 tests in `RoomAccountStoreTest`, `RoomMigrationV1ToV2Test`, `AdversarialSyncSqliteTest` PASS; physical device reboot restart and live UI observation held pending Gate G2. |
| AC02 | count1/count10 valid; count0/11 rejected. Repeat interval15 valid,14 rejected. Negative lead, missing deadline, overflowing conversion/addition and last>anchor rejected without mutation. 15:00/lead30/interval15/count3 preview14:30,14:45,15:00. Date-only09:00 not overdue that morning. | 01,05,07,10,11 | Deterministic shared behavior vectors plus actual preview/overdue UI | **Automated Subset PASS / Overall Pending UI Observation**: 9 tests in `ReminderScheduleCalculatorTest`, 7 in `AdversarialSchedulerBoundaryTest`, and 14 in `TodoSemanticsTest` PASS (bounds 1..10, min 15m, 64-bit overflow, date-only 09:00 morning); physical device preview/overdue UI observation held pending Gate G2. |
| AC03 | DST gap rejected; overlap requires offset, both options resolve correctly. Across API26/JVM targets saved anchor/overdue instants agree. Device zone/default/title/completion edits preserve anchors/token; date-only label stays captured date, timed list shows device zone. | 01,02,05,10,11 | Resolver vectors with actual target runtime, persisted values after edits, actual UI | **Automated Subset PASS / Overall Pending Device Observation**: 7 tests in `StrictTimeZoneResolverTest`, 15 in `TodoSemanticsTest` PASS (gap rejected, overlap offset required, NY spring/fall instants); live OS clock jump and cross-target agreement held pending Gate G2. |
